meta {
  name: 11 what it has worked out
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/_nl/analyze
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Understanding your data - what it has worked out

  What nlsearch currently believes each index holds: what the fields are for and what any coded values mean.

  This is the first place to look when an answer comes back wrong. A field decoded the wrong way shows up here in one read.
}
